From ba43a09e492ba1f7d39e6c65c4216cca5e442e60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 07:30:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sync surface with noctalia: add new tools, trim packages, no
 MSI/NVIDIA

- Add noctalia-shell (wallpaper/theming), copyq, antigravity, aurora-mpris
- Replace cliphist with copyq in niri.nix keybind and startup
- Update flake.nix with noctalia inputs (keep ironbar-flake for Surface)
- Merge flake.lock with noctalia pins + ironbar-flake entries
- Bump stateVersion to 26.11
- Replace sudo with doas; add nix gc, more binary caches
- Add mold/sccache cargo config for faster Rust builds
- Add printing, avahi, pipewire auto-switch-on-connect
- Improve ironbar: better BT popup/menu, split notif icon+count widgets, no NVIDIA GPU widget
- Improve neovim: clipboard setting, telescope keymaps, noice/notify plugins, copilot keybinds
- Improve zsh: add doas/agy/cl/shell aliases, unsetopt BEEP
- Trim home packages: drop davinci-resolve, onlyoffice, steam-tui/cmd, lutris, blockbench, aseprite, i2p, mullvad-browser, teams-for-linux, wayvr
- Add telegram-desktop, fzf; update nodejs_20 -> nodejs_26
- Add to systemPackages: mold, sccache, claude-code, mcp-nixos, freetube, qbittorrent-enhanced; drop cliphist
- Add programs.ccache, programs.appimage.binfmt, firewall ports, lp/scanner groups
- Surface-specific settings preserved: i915 iGPU, iHD VA-API, powersave governor, zen kernel
